# Phase 59: Nucleus Daemon (Unified Runtime)
**Goal:** Implement the "Presence-Aware" Daemon as a parallel service.
**Strategy:** Non-Destructive Additive Build.

## 1. Stage 0: Safety & Atomicity
*   [ ] **Locking:** Implement `BrainLock` utility using `fcntl` (UNIX) for [state.json](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/autonomous_state.json) and `ledger.json`.
*   [ ] **Validation:** Update [commitment_ledger.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py) and `BrainOps` to enforce lock-on-open.

## 2. Stage A: The Nucleus Daemon (Kernel)
*   [ ] **Package:** Initialize `mcp_server_nucleus/daemon/`.
*   [ ] **Lifecycle:** Implement `DaemonManager` to handle signal propagation (SIGTERM cleanup).
*   [ ] **Heartbeat:** Implement `InteractiveHeartbeat` (A tiny file `heartbeat.last` updated by both Server and Daemon).

## 3. Stage B: Preemptive Orchestrator
*   [ ] **Execution:** Modify [SwarmsOrchestrator](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/orchestrator.py#8-157) to support `async` non-blocking agent runs.
*   [ ] **Preemption:** Implement `MonitorTask` that kills agent runs if `heartbeat.last` is updated during execution.
*   [ ] **Handoff:** Implement logic for the Daemon to "Soft Yield" (Pause task) vs "Hard Yield" (Stop and re-queue).

## 4. Stage C: Non-Destructive CLI
*   [ ] **Module Entry:** Implement `mcp_server_nucleus.daemon.__main__`.
*   [ ] **Verification:** `verify_kernel_handoff.py` (Script to simulate human-agent task contention).

## 4. Verification (The Proof)
*   [ ] **Simulated Test:** `python scripts/verify_daemon.py`.
    *   Mock "User Active" -> Daemon Sleeps.
    *   Mock "User Offline" -> Daemon Wakes.

## 5. Safety
*   [ ] **Isolation:** The Daemon will use a separate log file `daemon.log`.
*   [ ] **No Conflict:** It will respect the [state.json](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/autonomous_state.json) locking mechanism (Atomic Claims) so it plays nice with any manual scripts running.
